--- !u!114 &804900243424111732
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 3042019410842442333}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9541d86e2fd84c1d9990edf0852d74ab, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshPro
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Unity 6.4 (version 6000.4.0f) is a major update to the Unity 6 series, \r\nfocusing on the performance optimization of the Universal Render \r\nPipeline (URP) and the integration of the latest technologies. Key \r\nupdates are as follows.\r\n\r\n1. Full transition to rendering graph\r\n\r\nRemove Compatibility Mode: Unity 6.4 stands for a complete \r\ntransition to the Render Graph API. Previous \"Compatibility Mode\" \r\nwas removed.\r\n\r\nHard old-fashioned: Old APIs that relied on traditional paths are now \r\ncompletely out of date, making the Render Graph workflow a must for \r\nprojects that upgrade to 6.4.\r\n\r\n2. GPU-based rendering and draw call optimization\r\n\r\nGPU Resident Draw: This feature significantly reduces CPU overhead \r\nby keeping draw data in GPU memory instead of resending it every \r\nframe. This is ideal for large environments.\r\n\r\nGPU occlusion cutting: Visibility calculations move from CPU to GPU, \r\nproviding more precise cutting and better performance on the latest \r\nhardware.\r\n\r\n3. Improve lighting and environment\r\n\r\nAdaptive Probe Volume (APV): This automated optical probe \r\nplacement system has been improved to provide high-quality indirect \r\nlighting without the manual work of an artist.\r\n\r\nScreen space enhancement: Optimized ambient blocking (SSAO) and \r\nshadow filtering options are specially improved for mobile and low-\r\ncost devices.\r\n\r\n4. Improvements to workflows and tools\r\n\r\nModifying rendering statistics: The statistics window has been \r\nredesigned to provide more intuitive data on rendering performance.\r\n\r\nMesh LOD Visualization: The new inspection slider allows developers \r\nto preview and adjust level of detail (LOD) transitions directly within \r\nscene view.\r\n\r\n5. Advanced Platform Support\r\n\r\nDirect Storage Consolidation: Support for Microsoft Direct Storage has \r\nbeen integrated to dramatically reduce asset loading times on PC and \r\nconsole platforms."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
